+/**
+ * Iterative extended Euclidean algorithm.
+ *
+ * Returns the greatest common divisor of `a` and `b` together with the Bézout
+ * coefficients `x` and `y` such that `a * x + b * y === gcd`. The returned gcd
+ * is always non-negative. This is a named export that lives alongside the
+ * default GCD export so existing callers remain unaffected.
